        Observe final provider-visible request bodies, Actor capability/resource projections, context epochs, streamed cache hit/miss facts, normalized token cost, fresh-process recovery, and live official/compatible DeepSeek behavior without treating prompts as lifecycle authority.
        </?01M0VXCB8Z9AHENCDEDTKQ0RZ9>
      )>
      <Actor { role = "MissionReconciler" project_ref = "host" } (
